lton!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.218.29.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a25dc82699766d51582e6a4df1af9eb3","RawContent":"Yay!! Can&#039;t wait!! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1849162,"PostDate":1399628980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay!! Can't wait!! <3\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.91.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d24088a37d5be98f75c23054fd7556a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies - TA Patty here - I am one of the BDW TA&#039;s specializing in the Caribbean. I have been to Royalton Punta Cana and it is awesome! I love the clean contemporary decor and those Dreams Beds are just heavenly! I have resort information for all of the Royalton properties. Please feel free to contact us if you would like any further information or if we can be of assistance with planning your dream wedding. PM or my direct email is patty@wrighttavelagency.com Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849191,"PostDate":1399636101,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies - TA Patty here - I am one of the BDW TA's specializing in the Caribbean. I have been to Royalton Punta Cana and it is awesome! I love the clean contemporary decor and those Dreams Beds are just heavenly! I have resort information for all of the Royalton properties. Please feel free to contact us if you would like any further information or if we can be of assistance with planning your dream wedding. PM or my direct email is patty@wrighttavelagency.com Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http: