{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6ed6b3a65f3f3abe87634273e34d9d9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1849092\" timestamp=\"1399598443\"]\nAfter a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!!  We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.\n \nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.\n \nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!! \n \nHappy Planning!!\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27815\"]view from upstairs walkway.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27816\"]pool.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27817\"]room.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27818\"]island off the beach.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27819\"]water sports.jpg[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27820\"]view from the gazebo.JPG[\/url]\n \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27821\"]wedding gazebo.JPG[\/url][\/quote]\nCongratulations!! I have also booked the Royalton White Sands. Wedding date set for  January 10th, 2015!! Could you send me the pictures if you don&#039;t mind? Falontubman@hotmail.com. Thank you very much.","Attachments":[],"Id":1849222,"PostDate":1399641433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 May 2014 - 09:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHappy Planning!!<br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27815' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from upstairs walkway.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27816' class='bbc_url' title=''>pool.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27817' class='bbc_url' title=''>room.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27818' class='bbc_url' title=''>island off the beach.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27819' class='bbc_url' title=''>water sports.jpg<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27820' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from the gazebo.JPG<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27821' class='bbc_url' title=''>wedding gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nCongratulations!! I have also booked the Royalton White Sands. Wedding date set for  January 10th, 2015!! Could you send me the pictures if you don't mind? Falontubman@hotmail.com. Thank you very much. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399367976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32de24fe8e5bc7e1e7112c0169a4feef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you and congratulations to you as well!!&amp;nbsp; Happy to email the pics&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849228,"PostDate":1399641972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you and congratulations to you as well!!\u00a0 Happy to email the pics\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51973dd94c50192f2244ac6f5d1d3f9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just thought I would share that I just received a 90 page PDF of flower, decor, etc. options from the wedding planner!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849312,"PostDate":1399652321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just thought I would share that I just received a 90 page PDF of flower, decor, etc. options from the wedding planner!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <3<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e87825118ea79c9b02d99e8bd0a4dd56","RawContent":"Thanks Pam!!! I&#039;m already picking out all my flowers from this PDF, so fun!!!\n\n\n:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1849325,"PostDate":1399657450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Pam!!! I'm already picking out all my flowers from this PDF, so fun!!!<br><br>\n<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed190d4da5600f9c2ef2bb5728236e1c","RawContent":":) no prob at all!! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1849329,"PostDate":1399658533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> no prob at all!! <3\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.24.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"926af5f15f4e1c9862fe7bedec103aa2","RawContent":"Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I&#039;m getting married there as well. You&#039;re lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I&#039;m new to forums so don&#039;t fully know the ins and outs. \n90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That&#039;s a lot of information.\nWhy can&#039;t I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums","Attachments":[],"Id":1849343,"PostDate":1399665345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I'm getting married there as well. You're lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I'm new to forums so don't fully know the ins and outs. <br \/>90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That's a lot of information.<br \/>Why can't I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394143195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399666437,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a2c8b9119abd0c4ead9418dcd1121ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Dimps! Ayaya I know it&#039;s frustrating not being able to open attachments!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just emailed it to you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have to get to 150 posts before you can open anything on this site! Or pay $30 I think it is.....&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m at like 70 posts - feel like I&#039;m never going to get there haha&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;oh scratch that - just noticed I&#039;m at 81 posts ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849344,"PostDate":1399666474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Dimps! Ayaya I know it's frustrating not being able to open attachments!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just emailed it to you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have to get to 150 posts before you can open anything on this site! Or pay $30 I think it is.....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm at like 70 posts - feel like I'm never going to get there haha<\/p>\n<br \/><p>oh scratch that - just noticed I'm at 81 posts <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf5ded57bb08ec89c97e812a828a8897","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Dimps\" post=\"1849343\" timestamp=\"1399679745\"]\nCongratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I&#039;m getting married there as well. You&#039;re lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I&#039;m new to forums so don&#039;t fully know the ins and outs. 90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That&#039;s a lot of information.Why can&#039;t I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums[\/quote]Thanks Dimps, congrats to you as well!!! I&#039;ll send you the pics today! :)\n\nHappy planning!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849514,"PostDate":1399740731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dimps, on 09 May 2014 - 07:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations Soon2beMrsJ! This is super exciting. I'm getting married there as well. You're lucky to be able to squeeze in a site visit. Can you send picks to me as well at dimps4dyz@hotmail.com I too am not able to see them. I'm new to forums so don't fully know the ins and outs. 90 pages!? Pamelas21 my gosh. That's a lot of information.Why can't I see the PDF? What am I not doing? #newtoforums<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks Dimps, congrats to you as well!!! I'll send you the pics today! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nHappy planning!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399894477,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a097ec46a31a50b78ff9eac3f2be51a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Congrats, I\u2019m so happy for you!! I get so happy every time another couple books here! :D&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;We have also booked our wedding at Royalton, May 27\/2015! While I already have all the PDFs relating to the flowers\/services they offer, I can\u2019t see any of the photos, do you mind sending them to me? My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:slweddingplan@%5Bmember=&#039;&gt;slweddingplan@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Was Chandlyn the wedding coordinator at RWS? I\u2019m planning on emailing soon and knowing the wedding coordinator\u2019s name would really help!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849924,"PostDate":1399894441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Congrats, I\u2019m so happy for you!! I get so happy every time another couple books here! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">We have also booked our wedding at Royalton, May 27\/2015! While I already have all the PDFs relating to the flowers\/services they offer, I can\u2019t see any of the photos, do you mind sending them to me? My email is <a href='mailto:slweddingplan@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>slweddingplan@gmail.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Was Chandlyn the wedding coordinator at RWS? I\u2019m planning on emailing soon and knowing the wedding coordinator\u2019s name would really help!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389129080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03595208f4ee4b6b7a9e49f5be9bf3b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!!!&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re really excited to have our wedding at the Royalton.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chandlyn is the Wedding Manager, but she also coordinates weddings.&amp;nbsp; I believe the other wedding coordinators are Laura and Ellie, but I didn&#039;t meet them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll email you the pics!&amp;nbsp; Happy Planning&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849934,"PostDate":1399897725,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks!!!!\u00a0 We're really excited to have our wedding at the Royalton.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Chandlyn is the Wedding Manager, but she also coordinates weddings.\u00a0 I believe the other wedding coordinators are Laura and Ellie, but I didn't meet them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll email you the pics!\u00a0 Happy Planning\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
