>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k-brown_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.14.40.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398160031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277678.jpg?_r=1403101424","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kail28","Id":277678,"Name":"kail28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e6a93e66fde13a45d72aaabcad6be1a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1850174\" timestamp=\"1400025771\"]\nI don&#039;t think I&#039;m ever going to email with Chandlyn. I&#039;m told I&#039;ll only deal with her when we land in Montego Bay!\n\nYou&#039;re a year away mysticjade! Enjoy that year! I&#039;m 6 months away and silently freaking out hahaha\n\n@[member=\"soontobemrsJ\"] Good luck dress shopping! &amp;lt;3[\/quote]Haha, I keep telling people that if I\u2019m already anxious a year out, I\u2019m going to be A MESS as the day gets closer. Weddings are hard. :P","Attachments":[],"Id":1852338,"PostDate":1401271329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 13 May 2014 - 08:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I don't think I'm ever going to email with Chandlyn. I'm told I'll only deal with her when we land in Montego Bay!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're a year away mysticjade! Enjoy that year! I'm 6 months away and silently freaking out hahaha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"255022\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255022-soontobemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">soontobemrsJ<\/span><\/a> Good luck dress shopping! <3<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Haha, I keep telling people that if I\u2019m already anxious a year out, I\u2019m going to be A MESS as the day gets closer. Weddings are hard. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389129080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80fa142b7ce6711db60c29a1b21348d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Mysticjade!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know! No one tells you how hard planning a wedding is! Plus you only get to do it once so you definitely want it to be perfect! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning hun! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852397,"PostDate":1401283331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Mysticjade!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know! No one tells you how hard planning a wedding is! Plus you only get to do it once so you definitely want it to be perfect! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning hun! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9d3bd21ce44f7d15df2104000ee17f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Don&#039;t you laugh at the people who say, \"Oh isn&#039;t planning a destination wedding so much easier than a regular wedding??\"&amp;nbsp; ummmmm NO&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have fun planning and I&#039;m sure we will all have beautiful weddings!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852407,"PostDate":1401285252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Don't you laugh at the people who say, \"Oh isn't planning a destination wedding so much easier than a regular wedding??\"\u00a0 ummmmm NO\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have fun planning and I'm sure we will all have beautiful weddings!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6d3c93f7d30a4e2a08a370134ec4f0c","RawContent":"Lol that actually happened to me this morning!\n\n\nA co worker said \"aww you&#039;re having a nice stress free wedding\" \n\n\nYeah right! Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1852408,"PostDate":1401285842,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lol that actually happened to me this morning!<br><br>\nA co worker said \"aww you're having a nice stress free wedding\" <br><br>\nYeah right! Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64bea9cab556d7af5471d998394653ee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1852408\" timestamp=\"1401300242\"]\nLol that actually happened to me this morning!\n\nA co worker said \"aww you&#039;re having a nice stress free wedding\"\n\nYeah right! Lol[\/quote]Oh my gosh, LOLing forever!\n\nPeople think it\u2019s easier and cheaper to do a DW, when that\u2019s totally not the case. The logistics are even worse!","Attachments":[],"Id":1852437,"PostDate":1401295882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 28 May 2014 - 02:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Lol that actually happened to me this morning!<br><br>\nA co worker said \"aww you're having a nice stress free wedding\"<br><br>\nYeah right! Lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh my gosh, LOLing forever!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>People think it\u2019s easier and cheaper to do a DW, when that\u2019s totally not the case. The logistics are even worse!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389129080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fbc1310080a6a412608365d4a9c7ce5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;YAY Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852459,"PostDate":1401303206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n   