{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cba4ade9372365568d7004713efc96c5","RawContent":"Hi everyone\n\n\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting :) x","Attachments":[],"Id":1852834,"PostDate":1401462259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone<br><br>\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"paula-1984@live.co.uk","IpAddress":"94.1.132.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401461892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278172.jpg?_r=1421157464","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"paulah1984","Id":278172,"Name":"paulah1984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fba1c59c05633bd7e60feafb12bcbbe7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"paulah1984\" post=\"1852834\" timestamp=\"1401476659\"]\nHi everyone\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting :) x[\/quote]Congrats!! I just booked our wedding a few weeks ago for April 2015 as well so definitely still working out the details. I&#039;m pretty sure we&#039;ll be doing the paradise package, with the cocktail hour and reception poolside. The ceremony depends on how many guests we have, but hoping the gazebo over the water works out!\n\nHappy planning!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1853246,"PostDate":1401696413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>paulah1984, on 30 May 2014 - 03:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi everyone<br>\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCongrats!! I just booked our wedding a few weeks ago for April 2015 as well so definitely still working out the details. I'm pretty sure we'll be doing the paradise package, with the cocktail hour and reception poolside. The ceremony depends on how many guests we have, but hoping the gazebo over the water works out!<br><br>\nHappy planning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69d8b1e527473f9a0d6e061c223b602c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found my dress!!&amp;nbsp; I tried on a bunch before I finally picked it&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854444,"PostDate":1402324036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found my dress!!\u00a0 I tried on a bunch before I finally picked it\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"adcb936f9f4f85b9d3314d0933b3bdbe","RawContent":"[quote name=\"paulah1984\" post=\"1852834\" timestamp=\"1401476659\"]\nHi everyone\n\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting :) x[\/quote]\nYAY! Congrats! paulah1984! I&#039;m getting married this November 18th, 2014! It&#039;s so close!\n\nWe&#039;re having the ceremony, cocktail hour and reception on the beach! &amp;lt;3\n\nHow about you?\n[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1854444\" timestamp=\"1402338436\"]\nI found my dress!!  I tried on a bunch before I finally picked it  :)[\/quote]\nSo happy for you! &amp;lt;3\n\nHow&#039;s planning going?","Attachments":[],"Id":1856117,"PostDate":1403175609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>paulah1984, on 30 May 2014 - 03:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone<br><br>\nI have just booked my wedding at Royalton White Sands for April 2015! Where are you having you ceremony and reception etc, what package have you chosen! Very exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> x<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>YAY! Congrats! paulah1984! I'm getting married this November 18th, 2014! It's so close!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're having the ceremony, cocktail hour and reception on the beach! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How about you?<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 09 June 2014 - 02:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I found my dress!!\u00a0 I tried on a bunch before I finally picked it\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So happy for you! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How's planning going?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23ac1fb5a8dd7aee7be7d26978502b49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!!!&amp;nbsp; Planning has kind of slowed down for now - I&#039;m not quite sure what&#039;s next!&amp;nbsp; We probably should be picking out invitations, getting welcome bag ideas together, favors, etc. but haven&#039;t quite gotten started yet.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope your planning is going well!&amp;nbsp; Only a few more months for you!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856267,"PostDate":1403187784,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you!!!!\u00a0 Planning has kind of slowed down for now - I'm not quite sure what's next!\u00a0 We probably should be picking out invitations, getting welcome bag ideas together, favors, etc. but haven't quite gotten started yet.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope your planning is going well!\u00a0 Only a few more months for you!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.96.28.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd0137d2411d1c5741e4fadfcc8327ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Are other outside vendors allowed, beside the photographers ?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858545,"PostDate":1404780192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Are other outside vendors allowed, beside the photographers ?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AnnaTennille & Eric<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 May 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Montego Bay, Jamaica<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150516\/e\/The+Day+We+Say+I+Do%21\/k\/b124\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"a.johnson1013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403184280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278601.jpg?_r=1403203318","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atennille","Id":278601,"Name":"atennille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c04399a97a098e05b2a9a730fabadf27","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think there&#039;s a vendor fee for any vendors not hired directly by the hotel - like if you have a package that includes flowers but you want more options so you hire a different florist, etc.&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t started looking at hiring any outside vendors yet so I&#039;m not sure what the cost is (but&amp;nbsp;for some reason I think it&#039;s $450 per vendor, maybe Chandlyn told me that amount).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really should be doing more planning&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858815,"PostDate":1404912706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think there's a vendor fee for any vendors not hired directly by the hotel - like if you have a package that includes flowers but you want more options so you hire a different florist, etc.\u00a0 I haven't started looking at hiring any outside vendors yet so I'm not sure what the cost is (but\u00a0for some reason I think it's $450 per vendor, maybe Chandlyn told me that amount).\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really should be doing more planning\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06af2fbbf97b5b728e14afa9cd547a2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What&#039;s quite funny about this is that I was married at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica resort in October 2011. Chandlyn was the WC at that resort then and her assistant was Donnalee White. We were just the two of us so Chandlyn has signed my marriage licence along with the assistant, and the pdf that I received that had all the bouquets and bouts and so on, looks almost exactly the same as what was sent from the GBPJ. Guess it really is a small world!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858836,"PostDate":1404918150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What's quite funny about this is that I was married at Gran Bahia Principe Jamaica resort in October 2011. Chandlyn was the WC at that resort then and her assistant was Donnalee White. We were just the two of us so Chandlyn has signed my marriage licence along with the assistant, and the pdf that I received that had all the bouquets and bouts and so on, looks almost exactly the same as what was sent from the GBPJ. Guess it really is a small world!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.96.249.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd7de65acfd9f9978b46471aebabb39a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t wait to to get married at the Royalton !&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859768,"PostDate":1405394443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\u00a0I can't wait to to get married at the Royalton !<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00