{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.42.51.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe2c30ffca2acfd5964d20f068c343c9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1849092\" timestamp=\"1399598443\"]\nAfter a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!!  We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.\n\nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.\n\nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!! \n\nHappy Planning!!\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27815\"]view from upstairs walkway.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27816\"]pool.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27817\"]room.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27818\"]island off the beach.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27819\"]water sports.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27820\"]view from the gazebo.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27821\"]wedding gazebo.JPG[\/url][\/quote]\nHi!\n\nCongrats on your wedding. I am also getting married at the Royalton next year :) . Could you please send these pictures to my email, I do not have enough of the required posts to download the pictures. [email=\"tenequia@live.com\"]tenequia@live.com[\/email]\n\nThanks!\n[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849312\" timestamp=\"1399666721\"]\nHey ladies!\n\nJust thought I would share that I just received a 90 page PDF of flower, decor, etc. options from the wedding planner!\n\nHappy planning! &amp;lt;3[\/quote]Hi Pam,\n\nCongrats on your wedding. I am getting married at the Royalton also and have been working with Laura with my planning. I received most of the wedding booklets but I do not recall seeing the 90 page pdf with flowers, decorations, etc. Could you send that to my email please? Thanks! [email=\"tenequia@live.com\"]tenequia@live.com[\/email]","Attachments":[],"Id":1863312,"PostDate":1406723529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 May 2014 - 09:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27815' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from upstairs walkway.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27816' class='bbc_url' title=''>pool.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27817' class='bbc_url' title=''>room.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27818' class='bbc_url' title=''>island off the beach.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27819' class='bbc_url' title=''>water sports.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27820' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from the gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27821' class='bbc_url' title=''>wedding gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your wedding. I am also getting married at the Royalton next year <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> . Could you please send these pictures to my email, I do not have enough of the required posts to download the pictures. <a href='mailto:tenequia@live.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>tenequia@live.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 09 May 2014 - 04:18 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just thought I would share that I just received a 90 page PDF of flower, decor, etc. options from the wedding planner!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <3<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your wedding. I am getting married at the Royalton also and have been working with Laura with my planning. I received most of the wedding booklets but I do not recall seeing the 90 page pdf with flowers, decorations, etc. Could you send that to my email please? Thanks! <a href='mailto:tenequia@live.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>tenequia@live.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tenequia@live.com","IpAddress":"12.42.51.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406722569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tdwilliams3124","Id":279230,"Name":"tdwilliams3124","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e69b6ae64e5b0cbc04882c4c6febc89b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sure @[member=\"tdwilliams3124\"], I will send them to you now!&amp;nbsp; Congrats!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863357,"PostDate":1406728142,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sure @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279230\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279230-tdwilliams3124\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tdwilliams3124<\/span><\/a>, I will send them to you now!\u00a0 Congrats!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.177.43.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"894db3ef00ec8d0f5bf0700ab92e54e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hey im only a few days after you on April 29, 2015 @ RIU Montego Bay, i seen that you did a site visit of the riu as well the royalton. If you still have any of the pics you took of the RIU weddings could you send them my way? i would be forever grateful! :) binzster@hotmail.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my new favorite website, im literally on it every day!! lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867137,"PostDate":1408271229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey im only a few days after you on April 29, 2015 @ RIU Montego Bay, i seen that you did a site visit of the riu as well the royalton. If you still have any of the pics you took of the RIU weddings could you send them my way? i would be forever grateful! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> binzster@hotmail.com\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my new favorite website, im literally on it every day!! lol\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"binzster@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.177.43.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404820810,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Binzster","Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53136609cb7b8633e56a17ebfe82db3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Binzster\"] That&#039;s so fun that our weddings are only a few days apart! I will definitely look through my pics from our trip and see if I took any of RIU weddings. We watched a few in the gazebo that is by the main entrance and bars, but didn&#039;t get to see any that were on the beach. I will email you if I have any pics!&amp;nbsp;There was one while we were staying there that sounded awesome, they had their reception on the top of the steakhouse at night and their DJ was great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867698,"PostDate":1408467109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278902\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278902-binzster\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Binzster<\/span><\/a> That's so fun that our weddings are only a few days apart! I will definitely look through my pics from our trip and see if I took any of RIU weddings. We watched a few in the gazebo that is by the main entrance and bars, but didn't get to see any that were on the beach. I will email you if I have any pics!\u00a0There was one while we were staying there that sounded awesome, they had their reception on the top of the steakhouse at night and their DJ was great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.177.43.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0de6fbae107238d4a4361c5c80033a71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Soon2beMrsJ&amp;nbsp; I have heard that the steakhouse is popular for dinner and reception, and a great place to party. So glad i found someone who&#039;s wedding is so close to mine in jamaica!!! now we can swap information, i have received quite a few emails on photographers in the area if you need anything&amp;nbsp; let me know :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ kevan stewart emailed and then they actually called me, wow wasnt expecting that haha, and they are very willing to work out a deal if you want a few of their services. Have you heard anything about this DJ?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867710,"PostDate":1408470089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Soon2beMrsJ\u00a0 I have heard that the steakhouse is popular for dinner and reception, and a great place to party. So glad i found someone who's wedding is so close to mine in jamaica!!! now we can swap information, i have received quite a few emails on photographers in the area if you need anything\u00a0 let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>DJ kevan stewart emailed and then they actually called me, wow wasnt expecting that haha, and they are very willing to work out a deal if you want a few of their services. Have you heard anything about this DJ?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"binzster@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.177.43.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404820810,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278902.jpg?_r=1427767958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Binzster","Id":278902,"Name":"Binzster","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ca507c9cff61b7d68c5316463a935bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Binzster&amp;nbsp; Yes it&#039;s awesome, we can definitely share info!&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m 99% sure we&#039;re going with Marcia Roberts for our photography, her photos are&amp;nbsp;beautiful and her prices are good too. I&#039;m actually reviewing the contract right now&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve heard very good things about Kevan Stewart!&amp;nbsp;I think I may go with the DJ the Royalton has, I hadn&#039;t really thought too much about an outside DJ yet.&amp;nbsp; Hmmmm.&amp;nbsp; Let me know what you decide!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867804,"PostDate":1408528359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Binzster\u00a0 Yes it's awesome, we can definitely share info!\u00a0I'm 99% sure we're going with Marcia Roberts for our photography, her photos are\u00a0beautiful and her prices are good too. I'm actually reviewing the contract right now\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've heard very good things about Kevan Stewart!\u00a0I think I may go with the DJ the Royalton has, I hadn't really thought too much about an outside DJ yet.\u00a0 Hmmmm.\u00a0 Let me know what you decide!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.44.38.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7010ebaf578af50c17359b272c8e3af","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1849092\" timestamp=\"1399598443\"]\nAfter a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!!  We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.\n\nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.\n\nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!! \n\nHappy Planning!!\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27815\"]view from upstairs walkway.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27816\"]pool.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27817\"]room.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27818\"]island off the beach.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27819\"]water sports.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27820\"]view from the gazebo.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27821\"]wedding gazebo.JPG[\/url][\/quote]@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] hi, I am fairly new to the site. I have chosen RWS for my wedding. I received some pics from the wedding dept. But I would love to see the pics you have in case they might offer a different vantage point. I am unable to view it though the site, so would you be kind enough to send i to my email. Thank you (jeritza_connell@yahoo.com)","Attachments":[],"Id":1868619,"PostDate":1408919084,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 May 2014 - 09:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27815' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from upstairs walkway.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27816' class='bbc_url' title=''>pool.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27817' class='bbc_url' title=''>room.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27818' class='bbc_url' title=''>island off the beach.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27819' class='bbc_url' title=''>water sports.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27820' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from the gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27821' class='bbc_url' title=''>wedding gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> hi, I am fairly new to the site. I have chosen RWS for my wedding. I received some pics from the wedding dept. But I would love to see the pics you have in case they might offer a different vantage point. I am unable to view it though the site, so would you be kind enough to send i to my email. Thank you (jeritza_connell@yahoo.com)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jeritza_connell@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"174.44.38.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407886981,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Ritzz","Id":279417,"Name":"Ritzz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c34ac2f7980f0b770190b5328658a7fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Ritzz&amp;nbsp;Sure, I will send you the pics today!&amp;nbsp;It is beautiful, you will love it&amp;nbsp; :)   Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868670,"PostDate":1408957967,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Ritzz\u00a0Sure, I will send you the pics today!\u00a0It is beautiful, you will love it\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.31.27.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f3dcc6d5aabf461a6d2e498ab4008b0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1849092\" timestamp=\"1399598443\"]\nAfter a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!!  We&#039;re so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.\n\nWe visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.\n\nI attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!! \n\nHappy Planning!!\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27815\"]view from upstairs walkway.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27816\"]pool.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27817\"]room.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27818\"]island off the beach.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27819\"]water sports.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27820\"]view from the gazebo.JPG[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=27821\"]wedding gazebo.JPG[\/url][\/quote]I&#039;m getting married in 2015 and this resort is at the top of my list!!!  I would love to know more.\n\nCan you PLEASE send me these documents? email: joy@fluxx.net.  I&#039;m new to this forum and I can&#039;t seem to access them!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870193,"PostDate":1409659092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 08 May 2014 - 09:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>After a TON of research and a few site visits, my fiance and I have finally chosen the Royalton White Sands for our April 25, 2015 wedding!!! \u00a0We're so excited to have the resort picked so we can start the planning and our guests can start figuring out their travel plans.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We visited the resort on May 3rd and met with Chandlyn, who showed us every spot on the resort. She was awesome and answered every question we had. The resort is amazing!!!! It is beyond beautiful and the people who work there are great as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I attached a few photos for the brides who wanted to see \"real\" pics!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27815' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from upstairs walkway.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27816' class='bbc_url' title=''>pool.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27817' class='bbc_url' title=''>room.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27818' class='bbc_url' title=''>island off the beach.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27819' class='bbc_url' title=''>water sports.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27820' class='bbc_url' title=''>view from the gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=27821' class='bbc_url' title=''>wedding gazebo.JPG<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm getting married in 2015 and this resort is at the top of my list!!!\u00a0 I would love to know more.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you PLEASE send me these documents? email: joy@fluxx.net.\u00a0 I'm new to this forum and I can't seem to access them!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachel@fluxx.net","IpAddress":"70.31.27.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409658618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279655.jpg?_r=1409673809","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Fluxx","Id":279655,"Name":"Fluxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89e38b894e1489f1c5eb51ccc1cfbe96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sure @[member=\"Fluxx\"] , I&#039;ll send them today!&amp;nbsp; You can&#039;t see attachments and stuff until you hit 150 posts (I haven&#039;t gotten there yet either)&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870217,"PostDate":1409664238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sure @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279655\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279655-fluxx\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Fluxx<\/span><\/a> , I'll send them today!\u00a0 You can't see attachments and stuff until you hit 150 posts (I haven't gotten there yet either)\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
