{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.74.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2571f0cdbb5bf8f7212249329763dcb3","RawContent":"If anyone has information about weddings \"the extra costs\"  can you please share them with me? We need to make a decision about the resort so we can invite our guests but I am nervous without knowing the wedding options. eek!! my email is mcgillapple@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1870604,"PostDate":1409862487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If anyone has information about weddings \"the extra costs\"  can you please share them with me? We need to make a decision about the resort so we can invite our guests but I am nervous without knowing the wedding options. eek!! my email is mcgillapple@hotmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402264593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"605d15b9b3091a227243f07a587afc90","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"mariak\"] I have a few PDF&#039;s with the wedding packages and the guide, I&#039;ll email them to you&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870663,"PostDate":1409908893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278327\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278327-mariak\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mariak<\/span><\/a> I have a few PDF's with the wedding packages and the guide, I'll email them to you\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec560a6865b5c940fb5d3b349016044e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Soon2beMrsJ\" post=\"1867804\" timestamp=\"1408542759\"]\n@Binzster  Yes it&#039;s awesome, we can definitely share info! I&#039;m 99% sure we&#039;re going with Marcia Roberts for our photography, her photos are beautiful and her prices are good too. I&#039;m actually reviewing the contract right now  :) \n \nI&#039;ve heard very good things about Kevan Stewart! I think I may go with the DJ the Royalton has, I hadn&#039;t really thought too much about an outside DJ yet.  Hmmmm.  Let me know what you decide![\/quote]What was ur quote from Marcia and kevon","Attachments":[],"Id":1885720,"PostDate":1423459744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Soon2beMrsJ, on 20 August 2014 - 09:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@Binzster\u00a0 Yes it's awesome, we can definitely share info!\u00a0I'm 99% sure we're going with Marcia Roberts for our photography, her photos are\u00a0beautiful and her prices are good too. I'm actually reviewing the contract right now\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI've heard very good things about Kevan Stewart!\u00a0I think I may go with the DJ the Royalton has, I hadn't really thought too much about an outside DJ yet.\u00a0 Hmmmm.\u00a0 Let me know what you decide!<\/p><\/div><\/div><br \/>What was ur quote from Marcia and kevon\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423457925,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1424816477","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.51.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0a45dd08aa2bd3c9fc2ca33df8a20a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dathotgal\"] I sent you the info! I don&#039;t have any costs on Kevan because we decided to go with the resort DJ, as we heard he is fantastic.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885745,"PostDate":1423486163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282047\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282047-dathotgal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dathotgal<\/span><\/a> I sent you the info! I don't have any costs on Kevan because we decided to go with the resort DJ, as we heard he is fantastic.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c54c0da274fed1ce59f8e2217a49bc89","RawContent":"Hi everyone! Looking at getting married at the Royalton white sands as well (2016) but having doubts as I have never been there! So scary to go into it blindly! I&#039;ve looked up info on all the Royalton resorts wedding packages- we visualize a sunset wedding near the beach and a private function afterwards- does anyone have any recommendations of where\/what to request (if we have a choice).. Also wondering for those who have been there personally what the beach is like, it&#039;s very important to have a nice beach as we spend the majority of the day there- I&#039;ve seen mixed reviews on trip advisor. Thanks for any info:) -J","Attachments":[],"Id":1887458,"PostDate":1424828612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! Looking at getting married at the Royalton white sands as well (2016) but having doubts as I have never been there! So scary to go into it blindly! I've looked up info on all the Royalton resorts wedding packages- we visualize a sunset wedding near the beach and a private function afterwards- does anyone have any recommendations of where\/what to request (if we have a choice).. Also wondering for those who have been there personally what the beach is like, it's very important to have a nice beach as we spend the majority of the day there- I've seen mixed reviews on trip advisor. Thanks for any info:) -J\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennacatoul@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.219.69.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424828011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282244.jpg?_r=1425438861","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JennaMC","Id":282244,"Name":"JennaMC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.51.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"497b480c5afb1d3a0fd81ddaf4e28b88","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"JennaMC\"], congrats on starting to plan your wedding!! We visited the Royalton last May to start planning ours, but we didn&#039;t stay there so I can&#039;t say too much about the beach. But&amp;nbsp;I walked on it for a few minutes to take some pics and the sand was nice and soft and the area was very clean. We&#039;re getting married at the beach gazebo at 2pm (the 4pm slot was&amp;nbsp;booked already)&amp;nbsp;and then having our reception poolside at night. There&#039;s a garden gazebo and also the beach area for ceremonies, and you can do your private dinner poolside or on the beach. There may be a few more options but I&#039;m not sure because once I heard poolside I was in&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel free to message me with your email address and I can send you some pics.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning! Our wedding is 2 months from today, yay!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887478,"PostDate":1424864833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282244\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282244-jennamc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennaMC<\/span><\/a>, congrats on starting to plan your wedding!! We visited the Royalton last May to start planning ours, but we didn't stay there so I can't say too much about the beach. But\u00a0I walked on it for a few minutes to take some pics and the sand was nice and soft and the area was very clean. We're getting married at the beach gazebo at 2pm (the 4pm slot was\u00a0booked already)\u00a0and then having our reception poolside at night. There's a garden gazebo and also the beach area for ceremonies, and you can do your private dinner poolside or on the beach. There may be a few more options but I'm not sure because once I heard poolside I was in\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to message me with your email address and I can send you some pics.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning! Our wedding is 2 months from today, yay!!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.167.138.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1424939780,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8b21aa5778cf32bf06f20adaf07811a","RawContent":"Thanks @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] \n\nAnd congrats as well! My coordinator has just sent me some options.. I&#039;m wondering what you gals are planning for music for the reception? Are you taking your own? I&#039;ve been to destination weddings before where they were able to have a DJ play, however this resort doesn&#039;t have a disco so I don&#039;t know who would be available- I guess outside vendors? We are a younger group (I&#039;m 28 and Stephen is 30) and most of our friends are our age- does anyone have any input re the nightly entertainment? Or going off site? Ie. Margaritaville for a night. - I&#039;ve read some reviews that have stated the there is no nightlife at all!\n\nMy email is jen_mc@live.ca :) thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887576,"PostDate":1424939680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> <br>\nAnd congrats as well! My coordinator has just sent me some options.. I'm wondering what you gals are planning for music for the reception? Are you taking your own? I've been to destination weddings before where they were able to have a DJ play, however this resort doesn't have a disco so I don't know who would be available- I guess outside vendors? We are a younger group (I'm 28 and Stephen is 30) and most of our friends are our age- does anyone have any input re the nightly entertainment? Or going off site? Ie. Margaritaville for a night. - I've read some reviews that have stated the there is no nightlife at all!<br>\nMy email is jen_mc@live.ca <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thanks again! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennacatoul@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.219.69.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424828011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282244.jpg?_r=1425438861","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JennaMC","Id":282244,"Name":"JennaMC","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.51.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4be9670928bf6b1b55b909f31f51d4d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JennaMC\"] We&#039;re having a DJ for all 4 hours of our poolside reception, the resort has one for a set amount per hour or you can hire an outside DJ. He will set up and we&#039;ll have a dance floor and everything, it&#039;s going to be awesome&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve heard about the slight&amp;nbsp;lack of nightlife at the Royalton as well. Since most of our&amp;nbsp;guests are either&amp;nbsp;older&amp;nbsp;family members who wouldn&#039;t&amp;nbsp;need too much craziness&amp;nbsp;or friends who&amp;nbsp;have young children so \"nightlife\" to them is having a dinner without crying, bottles or missing bedtime, so I&#039;m not too worried about there not being a dance club or anything at night. But Margaritaville sounds great! The majority of our guests will only be there from Thurs-Sunday with the wedding being on Saturday, so not too much time to leave the resort for us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll email you some beach pics today.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887580,"PostDate":1424945563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282244\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282244-jennamc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennaMC<\/span><\/a> We're having a DJ for all 4 hours of our poolside reception, the resort has one for a set amount per hour or you can hire an outside DJ. He will set up and we'll have a dance floor and everything, it's going to be awesome\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've heard about the slight\u00a0lack of nightlife at the Royalton as well. Since most of our\u00a0guests are either\u00a0older\u00a0family members who wouldn't\u00a0need too much craziness\u00a0or friends who\u00a0have young children so \"nightlife\" to them is having a dinner without crying, bottles or missing bedtime, so I'm not too worried about there not being a dance club or anything at night. But Margaritaville sounds great! The majority of our guests will only be there from Thurs-Sunday with the wedding being on Saturday, so not too much time to leave the resort for us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll email you some beach pics today.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1392759726","PhotoWidth":185,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.167.138.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"726c747177a9e36a65a8b28606a38b84","RawContent":"@[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] sounds great! Thanks for the info! Nice to know there will be music options available from the resort.. The less I have to plan and worry about the better!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887581,"PostDate":1424945863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> sounds great! Thanks for the info! Nice to know there will be music options available from the resort.. The less I have to plan and worry about the better! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennacatoul@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.219.69.228","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424828011,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282244.jpg?_r=1425438861","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JennaMC","Id":282244,"Name":"JennaMC","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
