Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":325,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1891025,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282561,"Name":"Sammi2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282561.jpg?_r=1428541544","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1427485120,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1891025,"PostDate":1427485120,"PostContent":"Hello all We are looking into planning a DW in 2016, and need some help, it all seems very overwh...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"baybee7@msn.com","IpAddress":"68.148.254.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427484568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282561.jpg?_r=1428541544","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sammi2016","Id":282561,"Name":"Sammi2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.148.254.252","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78990,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86a2179704f54f84690da1c19e528349","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are looking into planning a DW in 2016, and need some help, it all seems very overwhelming already. Right now we&#039;re looking at the Jellyfish restaurant and possibly staying at Now Larimar. If anyone has some tips and suggestions, I would greatly appreciate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think I need to find a venue and confirm the date before doing other planning, but I&#039;ve been waiting for quotes for a week. How long does this usually take?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;excitedly anxious&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sammi&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891025,"PostDate":1427485120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all<\/p>\n<p>We are looking into planning a DW in 2016, and need some help, it all seems very overwhelming already. Right now we're looking at the Jellyfish restaurant and possibly staying at Now Larimar. If anyone has some tips and suggestions, I would greatly appreciate it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think I need to find a venue and confirm the date before doing other planning, but I've been waiting for quotes for a week. How long does this usually take?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>excitedly anxious<\/p>\n<p>Sammi<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"baybee7@msn.com","IpAddress":"68.148.254.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427484568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282561.jpg?_r=1428541544","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sammi2016","Id":282561,"Name":"Sammi2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78990,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df3eb28d9a97fa6132554d03affbe0b0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome and congrats! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It really depends on your wedding coordinator, but I found mine was pretty slow to respond as well. Luckily you&#039;ve still got quite a bit of time. I can definitely agree that the beginning stages are extremely overwhelming, but can assure you that it does get better once you finalize all of the details and locations :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891026,"PostDate":1427485360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome and congrats! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It really depends on your wedding coordinator, but I found mine was pretty slow to respond as well. Luckily you've still got quite a bit of time. I can definitely agree that the beginning stages are extremely overwhelming, but can assure you that it does get better once you finalize all of the details and locations <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.133.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78990,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b66e58a63df3beba6fe3565401816df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just recently got back for my DW and honeymoon in Punta Cana. We stayed at Secrets Royal Beach for our honeymoon, but wondered onto Now Larimar for dinner a few times and it was great! The resort is really nice and the food was good! You won&#039;t be disappointed there!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891042,"PostDate":1427496812,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just recently got back for my DW and honeymoon in Punta Cana. We stayed at Secrets Royal Beach for our honeymoon, but wondered onto Now Larimar for dinner a few times and it was great! The resort is really nice and the food was good! You won't be disappointed there!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.175.124.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78990,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5849742731228d4f54a1185535653f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Sammi and Congrats on your upcoming DR wedding!!! you&#039;re sure to find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you all the best and Enjoy your journey - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891120,"PostDate":1427557828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Sammi and Congrats on your upcoming DR wedding!!! you're sure to find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best and Enjoy your journey - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_o.jpg\" alt=\"10931505_10153038436459487_8294167073024\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78990","Title":"Dw In Punta Cana 2016","LastPostDate":1427557828},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
