Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":356,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1887222,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282214,"Name":"miriv1005","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1424712874,"LastPoster":{"Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1887222,"PostDate":1424712874,"PostContent":"Hello all, \u00a0 My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning our wedding at PPC for May 6, 2016. Our\u00a0guest list is c...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miriv1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424712426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"miriv1005","Id":282214,"Name":"miriv1005","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"721a4793d69d4890871d20c0a01b6577","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning our wedding at PPC for May 6, 2016. Our&amp;nbsp;guest list is currently 60 or so guests, are there any brides that can give me a rough estimate of their total expenses for a wedding of about 60 at PPC.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are planning to go with a plated dinner but are afraid that the wedding will easily run us 20K and we are trying to stay between 12-16. We have chosen the Aqua package since it was the best option to pay the extra fee per person. Did any brides give favors or used Dominican favors as their vendor for favors?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice would be greatly appreciated! Thank you in advance!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887222,"PostDate":1424712874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning our wedding at PPC for May 6, 2016. Our\u00a0guest list is currently 60 or so guests, are there any brides that can give me a rough estimate of their total expenses for a wedding of about 60 at PPC.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning to go with a plated dinner but are afraid that the wedding will easily run us 20K and we are trying to stay between 12-16. We have chosen the Aqua package since it was the best option to pay the extra fee per person. Did any brides give favors or used Dominican favors as their vendor for favors?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice would be greatly appreciated! Thank you in advance!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miriv1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424712426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"miriv1005","Id":282214,"Name":"miriv1005","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.76.184.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"084accdc6b000edfe1d07ff766463687","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, I leave for Punta Cana on Wednesday, and will be using Dominican Favors for my wedding. So far Jimmy at Dominican Favors has been great to deal with and they deliver right to the resort, which is a huge relief. I will let you know when I get back how everything went with this vendor. Happy planning.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887978,"PostDate":1425312866,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I leave for Punta Cana on Wednesday, and will be using Dominican Favors for my wedding. So far Jimmy at Dominican Favors has been great to deal with and they deliver right to the resort, which is a huge relief. I will let you know when I get back how everything went with this vendor. Happy planning.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_jansen1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.184.146","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1395492327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ajansen1","Id":277283,"Name":"ajansen1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.111.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"579348cfa37676f5e04e02dfb2d7d34a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, miriv1005 and Congrats on your destination wedding next year!!! you&#039;ll find lots of great ideas, advice and suggestions here to help with your planning decisions, so are already off to a great start :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To help on your journey, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera to inspire you further....with more at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos&lt;\/a&gt; ....enjoy - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10661685_10152650091649487_8724117653734714842_o.jpg\" alt=\"10661685_10152650091649487_8724117653734\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10329825_10152586142924487_3450657429731469229_o.jpg\" alt=\"10329825_10152586142924487_3450657429731\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10428182_10152562437969487_962117043379211812_o.jpg\" alt=\"10428182_10152562437969487_9621170433792\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887997,"PostDate":1425317429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, miriv1005 and Congrats on your destination wedding next year!!! you'll find lots of great ideas, advice and suggestions here to help with your planning decisions, so are already off to a great start <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To help on your journey, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera to inspire you further....with more at this link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos<\/a> ....enjoy - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10661685_10152650091649487_8724117653734714842_o.jpg\" alt=\"10661685_10152650091649487_8724117653734\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10329825_10152586142924487_3450657429731469229_o.jpg\" alt=\"10329825_10152586142924487_3450657429731\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10428182_10152562437969487_962117043379211812_o.jpg\" alt=\"10428182_10152562437969487_9621170433792\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba749a9b3cec58c23db8310bc008d458","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ajansen1 thank you so much for replying to my post, I look forward to your feedback. I hope everything goes well and have a wonderful wedding!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888344,"PostDate":1425497163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ajansen1 thank you so much for replying to my post, I look forward to your feedback. I hope everything goes well and have a wonderful wedding!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"miriv1005@gmail.com","IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424712426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"miriv1005","Id":282214,"Name":"miriv1005","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78832,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c74dedf79fc8dec27aeb2ea44fc2add2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"miriv1005\" post=\"1887222\" timestamp=\"1424712874\"]\nHello all,\n\nMy fianc\u00e9 and I are planning our wedding at PPC for May 6, 2016. Our guest list is currently 60 or so guests, are there any brides that can give me a rough estimate of their total expenses for a wedding of about 60 at PPC.\n\nWe are planning to go with a plated dinner but are afraid that the wedding will easily run us 20K and we are trying to stay between 12-16. We have chosen the Aqua package since it was the best option to pay the extra fee per person. Did any brides give favors or used Dominican favors as their vendor for favors?\n\nAny advice would be greatly appreciated! Thank you in advance![\/quote]I was going to go with Paradisus as well. Until i realized it would cost a ton to add on extra people and decor. So I am going with Kukua. It&#039;s less expensive and you get that personal touch. Good Luck and Happy Planning:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1890461,"PostDate":1427123035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>miriv1005, on 23 February 2015 - 09:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning our wedding at PPC for May 6, 2016. Our\u00a0guest list is currently 60 or so guests, are there any brides that can give me a rough estimate of their total expenses for a wedding of about 60 at PPC.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning to go with a plated dinner but are afraid that the wedding will easily run us 20K and we are trying to stay between 12-16. We have chosen the Aqua package since it was the best option to pay the extra fee per person. Did any brides give favors or used Dominican favors as their vendor for favors?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice would be greatly appreciated! Thank you in advance!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I was going to go with Paradisus as well. Until i realized it would cost a ton to add on extra people and decor. So I am going with Kukua. It's less expensive and you get that personal touch. Good Luck and Happy Planning:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394133176,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78832","Title":"Paradisus Punta Cana May 2016 Wedding...help!","LastPostDate":1427123035},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
